  "actions_note": "Actions are assigned to specific owners based on the findings. For example, the Ward pharmacist / trust VTE lead is responsible for implementing VTE prophylaxis on admission clerking checklists and ensuring pharmacist reconciliation within 24 hours, addressing the dominant reason for delays in H4. Other actions, such as escalating to site managers for bed availability and referring confirmation call-backs, are assigned to relevant leads.",
